        <annot>Transcription: Corpus Monodicum (Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz / Universität Würzburg), document NY 905-II-0192-6TR, https://stagedata.corpus-monodicum.de/mei/b4386715-8f1b-4d90-ade9-42767952a65b/NY%20905-II-0192-6TR.xml, made with OMMR4all according to Corpus Monodicum's record, corrected against the facsimile for eChant (see corpus-monodicum-corrected/corrections.md); © Corpus Monodicum. Pitches at the manuscript's level, a fifth above the Graduale Synopticum witnesses, and an octave lower than the file.</annot>
